icle"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260730 173132.769</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On"></FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">Address Dependent Locality</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment"></FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">019FB3A7-16A6-7B82-AB46-D772F7C720C3</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status">Develop</FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">019FB3A7-16A6-77AB-82D1-317A6A289EBF</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260730 173139.814</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On"></FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">Address Deposited Plan</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment"></FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">019FB3A7-22BC-7CC8-898A-DF83D1EA01EE</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status">Develop</FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">019FB3A7-22BC-7AAE-A3E0-54F3799EB7A1</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260730 173142.908</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On"></FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">Address Door</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment">The vertical component participates in identity. Two Spanish addresses differing only in door are as distinct as two differing in house number, so floor and door cannot be relegated to an unstructured "unit" line without losing uniqueness - and that is exactly the reflex of models built in countries with mostly-detached housing.</FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">019FB3A7-1913-7743-9390-1AAB4A78B75E</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status">Develop</FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">019FB3A7-1913-748F-8A35-DC27A8E9C707</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260730 173140.435</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On">20260730 173213.059</FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">Address Double Dependent Locality</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment">Two independent levels of dependent locality exist in the UK and both are needed to disambiguate rural populations; most models allow one. Presupposes a dependent locality.</FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">019FB3A7-170F-78C9-8A14-3867AF0AECD3</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status">Develop</FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">019FB3A7-170F-7775-883B-D12172CE63C8</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260730 173139.919</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On">20260730 173213.188</FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">Address Dutch Postcode</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment"></FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">019FB3A7-1194-7942-AD0D-4075B959FB80</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status">Develop</FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">019FB3A7-1194-7149-8B68-FB76DD8BCA3D</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260730 173138.516</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On"></FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">Address Eircode</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment">The identifier portion is deliberately non-geographic and unordered: neighbouring dwellings share nothing beyond the routing key. Nothing below the routing key is derivable from the code, and the code is derivable from nothing else. Before Eircode the descriptive facts genuinely did not identify - dozens of dwellings in one townland shared identical address text. That historical population is worth keeping as a live example of a designation that fails to designate.</FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">019FB3A7-1EFA-7AC6-B463-87AFEA1EA1AE</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespa