><FIELD Name="Concept Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status">Develop</FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">019FB3A6-FBCA-79BB-A35D-A5C7C3B8F860</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260730 173132.938</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On"></FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">Address Lot Number</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment"></FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">019FB3A7-2240-7E2F-9351-34CAD01F7C10</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status">Develop</FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">019FB3A7-2240-792D-9D2B-3E0360269962</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260730 173142.784</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On"></FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">Address Paradigm</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment">Which paradigm an address follows changes over time - the lot-to-street transition forced by the Australian population. The transition is NOT the destruction and recreation of the address, which would lose the continuity every downstream system needs; it is a new period of validity on the same address. Carried by the Valid Time flag on this fact type rather than by a date role, because the date only records when the assignment became true.</FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">019FB3A6-FB56-7577-BFAB-4E9B17400E67</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal">Valid Time</FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status">Develop</FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">019FB3A6-FB56-7108-9569-EEAE94BBA7A8</