me="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment">Number or building name, at least one: "Rose Cottage, Nether Poppleton, York" is a complete, deliverable, unambiguous address containing no number whatsoever. That disjunction spans two object types - Address Premise Number is played by Thoroughfare Address while Address Building Name is played by this subtype - so it cannot be expressed as one set constraint and is recorded here. Post town and postcode are both mandatory.</FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">019FB3A7-0C3B-78DC-8FDA-4ABF9C4F17C4</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status">Develop</FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">019FB3A7-0C3B-7DA8-A25C-68853614E343</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260730 173137.147</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On">20260730 173215.899</FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">Go</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">L</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type">integer</FIELD><FIELD Nam