ame="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type">string</FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment">Value pattern /^[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{4}$/.</FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">019FB3A7-1E29-72B0-8C40-1BE07417562C</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">019FB3A7-1E29-75D1-BD0E-DA17E7B55BFB</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260730 173141.737</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On">20260730 173215.370</FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">JP Block Address</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">N</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment">Address Thoroughfare is not optional here, it is INAPPLICABLE. Numbering proceeds by block within a named area, and in older districts numbering within a block follows registration order rather than geography, so adjacency in the data implies nothing about adjacency in the world; most Japanese streets have no name at all. This single population is the clearest justification for subtyping over one wide optional type - a wide type would carry a street role that can never be truthfully filled for tens of millions of addresses. Large buildings hold their own postal code, sometimes floor-specific, which is why the postal code attaches to the address rather than deriving from the admin unit.</FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">019FB3A7-0D88-703E-9710-BD82213C0BD4</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status">Develop</FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">019FB3A7-0D88-7DDE-A1BF-334E4BE5BD95</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260730 173137.480</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On">20260730 173212.411</FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">Korpus</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">L</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="S