A real place on the earth, distinct from any designation of it. A building outlives its name: municipal mergers, street renames, postcode reallocation and the dissolution of states all change the designation while the bricks stay put, and Australian lot addresses become street addresses without anything physical occurring at all. Separating location from designation is the one decision genuinely expensive to retrofit.</FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">019FB3A6-FA7A-7B32-A33B-F3C85B69C0E6</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status">Develop</FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">019FB3A6-FA7A-7DFD-B3E4-B2D12D29C807</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260730 173132.602</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On">20260730 173211.576</FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">Location Code</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">L</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type">string</FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"