population"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">019FB3A7-06FE-7BAE-9D68-C19D24C3D40D</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260730 173135.805</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On"></FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">Rendering</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">N</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment">[Definition]
One correct presentation of an address as an ordered sequence of lines, for a given script and purpose. Objectified because an address may have more than one correct rendering - Japan alone requires two per address (Japanese script domestic, Latin script international) with INVERTED element order. Immutable once produced: correcting an address produces a new rendering rather than editing an existing one, which is what makes an invoice reproducible as sent.</FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">019FB3A7-021A-7F78-9C7B-C71D8A7356F3</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal">Transaction Time</FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status">Develop</FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">019FB3A7-021A-7AC3-884E-52C4D13794BA</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260730 173134.554</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On">20260730 173211.759</FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">Rendering Line</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment">A sequenced line fact type, not three fixed roles. Three roles fix an arbitrary cardinality into the schema, leave most of the population with empty roles, and force a migration the first time a Japanese building name and floor push an address to six lines. The sequence must be gapless and every rendering has a line 1.</FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">019FB3A7-029A-7EBC-B95A-775429A85FCF</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status">Develop</FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">019FB3A7-029A-7B8B-8CDA-6E45C57DABCC</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260730 173134.682</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On">20260730 173214.179</FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">Rendering Line Position</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">N</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD N