e="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260730 173142.192</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On"></FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">US Thoroughfare Address</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">N</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment"></FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">019FB3A7-0BEF-7C08-81B4-2F55464DF04D</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status">Develop</FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">019FB3A7-0BEF-7919-8C04-F790660EEC8B</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260730 173137.071</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On">20260730 173138.631</FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">Usage</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">N</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment">[Definition]
The use a party makes of an address - billing, shipping, registered office, place of birth, tax residence. The role of use belongs to the connecting fact type, never to the address. Put usage inside Address and no address instance is ever reusable, deduplication becomes impossible, and the constraint that a registered office may not be a post box cannot be expressed at all.</FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">019FB3A7-08C2-778A-B69E-5955C1BAB051</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal">Valid Time</FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status">Develop</FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">019FB3A7-08C2-7C54-A7EF-9B159D1F0CAB</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260730 173136.258</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On">20260730 173211.887</FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">Usage Assertion</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment">The communication-oriented heart of the model. An address supplied by a customer is not a fact about the world; it is a statement made by a party at a moment, and it may be wrong. Modelled as a plain attribute of Party, the statement and its truth are fused; modelled as a fact with an asserter and a date they separate - and verification against a registry becomes another fact with its own date and outcome rather than a boolean flag whose meaning erodes.</FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">019FB3A7-0912-798D-A0AC-9D0731E8FB2F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal">Transaction Time</FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status">Develop</FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">019FB3A7-0912-7D3A-9747-C8256F94AE2E</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260730 173136.338</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On">20260730 173213.633</FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">Usage Kind</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">N</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment">XC2: an address used as a REGISTERED_OFFICE may not be a Postbox Address - jurisdiction-dependent, and a governed exception list is needed in practice. This is expressible at all only because usage lives in the connecting fact type rather than on Address; it is the concrete payoff of that decision, and worth pointing at when someone proposes an address_type column.</FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">019FB3A7-044F-794E-AA79-150D86CCA0D6</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status">Develop</FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">019FB3A7-044F-7A36-8281-AD016602E23F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260730 173135.119</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On">20260730 173216.166</FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">Usage Kind Code</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">L</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type">string</FIELD><FIEL